":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T13:22:56-07:00","id":868700,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/868670-nockers-and-c20#post868670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">a Few things that have occured to me.<br /> <br /> First will the Nockers Compulsion to use expletives (which is mostly in their kithbook which I lament to say I only briefly glanced at once in a store) Be added to their Frailtys list.<br /> <br /> Its better then their every creation having some &quot;elusive Flaw&quot; I think.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope. We got the Nocker writeup during the Kickstarter, and their frailty is that all their creations have a minor but irreparable flaw.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also any ideas how Nocker Genius would try adapting to more modern tech like Tablets E readers and smart phones. </div> </div> </div>Well, the C20 excerpt says engineering and programming are ideal Nocker jobs, and some more modern Nockers seek out computer programmers and makers of electrical devices for Glamour.<br /> <br /> One of the Nocker birthrights has gone from creating non-living chimera to Macguyvering, whipping up temporary chimerical items from improvised materials. I <i>think</i> forging and reshaping chimera has been opened up to all Kithain.<br /> <br /> Where Nockers have a problem is with their other birthright, Fix-It, which has -1 die to the roll for modern electrical devices.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}